(a) The following occupation taxes shall be levied and collected in the city for the tax year beginning January 1, 2025, and for each and every year thereafter, until changed by ordinances.
(b) The occupation taxes provided for herein shall be due and payable February 1 of each year, and shall be delinquent if not paid by March 1 of each year, and each February 1 and March 1 thereafter, or on or before date of beginning of any business, calling, vocation, or profession in the city for which an occupation tax is required.
(c) Schedule of occupation taxes. The schedule of occupational taxes shall be as follows:
(1) General businesses.
